![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTk3NzM1LCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--452320b66befe4473e64714d2b10c5758fa03f1f/BR%20(2).png) Estamos ansiosos para recebê-los e queremos compartilhar algumas dicas importantes para os competidores e acompanhantes:
​
- **Sua inscrição será confirmada no site da WCA assim que o pagamento for confirmado e o comprovante for enviado.** Para mais informações, acesse a aba de [Inscrição](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CuboemEtapasVilaVelha2026/register);
- Recomendamos chegar ao local da competição pelo menos 30 minutos antes do início da modalidade em que você irá participar;
- Certifique-se de que o cubo que você usará na competição esteja em boas condições, pois cubos danificados podem ser recusados; 
- Estamos aqui para ajudar! Se você tiver alguma dúvida, fique à vontade para perguntar;
- Se este for o seu primeiro campeonato, assista a [este vídeo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UHqunxu3rOU);
- Antes da competição, leia as [Regulamentações da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/translations/portuguese-brazilian) para estar familiarizado com as regras;
- Divirta-se e aproveite ao máximo!
​
-------------------------------------
​
![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTk3NzM0LCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--7cc91f261678c6cb3253be36e27fef7f8f3b2c35/UK%20(2).png) We are excited to welcome you and want to share some essential tips for competitors and companions:
​
- **Your registration will be confirmed on the WCA website as soon as the payment is confirmed and the receipt is sent.** For more information, visit the [Registration](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/IICuboemEtapasVilaVelha2026/register) tab;
- We recommend arriving at the competition venue at least 30 minutes before the start of the event you will participate in;
- Make sure that the cube you will use in the competition is in good condition, as damaged cubes may not be accepted;
- We are here to assist you! If you have any questions, feel free to ask;
- If this is your first competition, watch [this video](https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=8dSuMG--wm8&pp=ygUhSG93IHRvIGNvbXBldGUgaW4gd2NhIGNvbXBldGl0aW9u);
- Before the competition, read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations) to become familiar with the rules;
- Have fun and make the most of the experience!
​
-------------------------------------
#### Organização/Organization:
​
![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBc1JMIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--21d308c05a84a509a0a5091b9aae85d06e9b68c7/speedcubes-logo-0.25x.png)

#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres miembro de la **Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES)**, se te reembolsará el 15% de la cuota de registro. Puedes hacerte miembro de la AES pinchando [aquí](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).
Al registrarte en esta competición aceptas que **se te enviarán correos electrónicos informativos**. El equipo organizador no se hace responsable de los perjuicios ocasionados si se proporcionan direcciones de correo no funcionales.

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member, you will be reimbursed 15% of the registration fee. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).
By registering to this competition you accept that **informative emails will be sent**. The organization team does not take responsibility for any damage caused if non-functional email adresses are provided.
